{"id":"n58584-3-5","stage":5,"title":"보글보글 · 卷卷地","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58584-3-5-1","ko":"왜 항상 머리를 짧게 잘라?","zh":"为什么你总是把头发剪得这么短？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么。","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"항상","meaning":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","explanation":"항상：总，总是，老，老是，经常。","readings":[{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83162","senseId":"1","lemma":"항상","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"항상","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3"}},{"text":"머리를","meaning":"头发","explanation":"머리：头发；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"머리","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66234","senseId":"3","lemma":"머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머리를","audio":"/audio/7100300a7b419bcb6fd3.mp3"}},{"text":"짧게","meaning":"短","explanation":"짧다：短；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"짧다","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71363","senseId":"1","lemma":"짧다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"짧게","audio":"/audio/d68f30912311d995dabc.mp3"}},{"text":"잘라?","meaning":"剪掉，切掉","explanation":"자르다：剪掉，切掉；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"자르다","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17787","senseId":"4","lemma":"자르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘라","audio":"/audio/f215e75313727961651d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"f1d42a32366087dd","term":"항상","zh":"总，总是，老，老是，经常","audio":"/audio/f1d42a32366087dde8c3.mp3","entryId":"83162","definition":"无论什么时候都没变地。","pronunciation":["항상"]},{"id":"74eee3ddf202a62b","term":"머리","zh":"头发","audio":"/audio/74eee3ddf202a62b7596.mp3","entryId":"66234","definition":"生长在头上的毛发。","pronunciation":["머리"]},{"id":"6dab7d40289b180d","term":"짧다","zh":"短","audio":"/audio/6dab7d40289b180d0cb0.mp3","entryId":"71363","definition":"空间或物体的两头距离近。","pronunciation":["짤따"]},{"id":"1d818f15fdfd54e5","term":"자르다","zh":"剪掉，切掉","audio":"/audio/1d818f15fdfd54e51260.mp3","entryId":"17787","definition":"从整体中将一部分拿掉。","pronunciation":["자르다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73da8f788bc1d283cf96.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58584-3-5-2","ko":"나는 곱슬머리라 조금만 길러도 보글보글 지저분해 보이거든.","zh":"因为我天生是卷发，稍微留长一点就会变得卷曲凌乱，看起来很不好看。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"곱슬머리라","meaning":"卷发，卷发的人","explanation":"곱슬머리：卷发，卷发的人；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；라：连接名词判断、引用内容或相应的后续表达。","readings":[{"term":"곱슬머리","audio":"/audio/faae53884ce0010feeea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18632","senseId":"1","lemma":"곱슬머리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"곱슬머리라","audio":"/audio/8b40a6481bc8311440dc.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"一点点，稍微，略微","explanation":"조금：一点点，稍微，略微；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"1","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"길러도","meaning":"留，蓄","explanation":"기르다：留，蓄；어도：表示让步：“即使、就算”；-아/어도 되다 表示“可以”。","readings":[{"term":"기르다","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62242","senseId":"6","lemma":"기르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길러도","audio":"/audio/3439bb27a0ed96a9768f.mp3"}},{"text":"보글보글","meaning":"卷卷地","explanation":"보글보글：卷卷地。","readings":[{"term":"보글보글","audio":"/audio/f7113583141d5d81198f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58584","senseId":"3","lemma":"보글보글","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보글보글","audio":"/audio/f7113583141d5d81198f.mp3"}},{"text":"지저분해","meaning":"杂乱","explanation":"지저분하다：杂乱；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"지저분하다","audio":"/audio/8db48a7863a37c7a29f1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27948","senseId":"1","lemma":"지저분하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지저분해","audio":"/audio/de3ffc8b5589b5987466.mp3"}},{"text":"보이거든.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；거든：补充理由或背景，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이거든","audio":"/audio/d950077b07a65bcd8252.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"faae53884ce0010f","term":"곱슬머리","zh":"卷发，卷发的人","audio":"/audio/faae53884ce0010feeea.mp3","entryId":"18632","definition":"曲折成卷的头发，或具有那种头发的人。","pronunciation":["곱쓸머리"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"一点点，稍微，略微","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"微量或微小的程度。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"8b121394eb596253","term":"기르다","zh":"留，蓄","audio":"/audio/8b121394eb596253aeec.mp3","entryId":"62242","definition":"让头发或胡须等长长。","pronunciation":["기르다"]},{"id":"f7113583141d5d81","term":"보글보글","zh":"卷卷地","audio":"/audio/f7113583141d5d81198f.mp3","entryId":"58584","definition":"头发接连卷成又短又圆的样子。","pronunciation":["보글보글"]},{"id":"8db48a7863a37c7a","term":"지저분하다","zh":"杂乱","audio":"/audio/8d